@page
@model KopiCinta.Pages.RotiCintaByArdisaModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Roti Cinta by Ardisa";
}

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">

        <!-- BACK -->
        <div class="back-top reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Collaborations">← Back</a>
        </div>

        <!-- HERO -->
        <div class="event-hero reveal">
            <div class="event-hero-text">
                <p class="eyebrow">Collaborations & Campaigns</p>
                <h2>Roti Cinta by Ardisa</h2>

                <p class="event-intro">
                    A collaboration that turned passion into opportunity —
                    where growth, confidence, and creativity came together through one story.
                </p>

                <div class="event-tags">
                    <span>Product Collaboration</span>
                    <span>Empowerment</span>
                    <span>Inclusive Growth</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="event-hero-img">
                <img src="/images/roti-cinta/DSC08292.JPG" alt="Roti Cinta by Ardisa">
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- QUOTE -->
        <div class="hbii-quote reveal">
            <p>
                “It’s not about ability — it’s about the opportunity to grow.”
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- STORY 1 -->
        <div class="hbii-block reveal">
            <div class="hbii-block-text">
                <p class="hbii-label">A Place to Grow</p>
                <h3>More Than Just Work</h3>

                <p>
                    Kopi Cinta is not only a place to work, but also a place to grow.
                    This is not just a statement — it is a commitment we consistently uphold.
                </p>

                <p>
                    We continuously support every member of our team in developing
                    their potential, including Ardisa, one of our Deaf baristas
                    who has a strong passion for cooking.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-block-card">
                <h4>What This Collaboration Represents</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>Personal growth</li>
                    <li>Creative expression</li>
                    <li>Real opportunities</li>
                    <li>Inclusive support</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- IMAGE BREAK -->
        <div class="featured-grid reveal">
            <img src="/images/roti-cinta/DSC08319.JPG" alt="">
            <img src="/images/roti-cinta/DSC08321.JPG" alt="">
            <img src="/images/roti-cinta/DSC08325.JPG" alt="">
        </div>

        <!-- STORY 2 -->
        <div class="hbii-feature reveal">
            <div class="hbii-feature-card">
                <p class="hbii-label">The Beginning</p>
                <h3>From Passion to Product</h3>

                <p>
                    Ardisa is highly skilled in making a variety of foods and pastries.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Through our collaboration with Roti Arum, we provided her with
                    a platform to develop her signature product —
                    <em>Roti Cinta (Love Bread)</em>.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-feature-card soft">
                <p class="hbii-label">Taking the Lead</p>
                <h3>More Than Just Making</h3>

                <p>
                    Beyond production, Ardisa was directly involved in selling
                    and introducing her products to customers.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Through a pop-up booth at Harmoni Cafe and Resto during Ramadan,
                    she connected with people in her own way.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STORY 3 -->
        <div class="kbi-section reveal">
            <div class="kbi-img">
                <img src="/images/roti-cinta/DSC08291.JPG" alt="">
            </div>

            <div class="kbi-text">
                <h3>A Meaningful Response</h3>

                <p>
                    The response was overwhelmingly positive.
                    Customers praised the taste and quality of the products,
                    recognizing the effort and care behind each one.
                </p>

                <p>
                    More than that, they appreciated Ardisa’s confidence
                    and her ability to communicate with customers.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STORY 4 -->
        <div class="hbii-block reverse reveal">
            <div class="hbii-block-text">
                <p class="hbii-label">Understanding Inclusivity</p>
                <h3>Beyond Limitations</h3>

                <p>
                    Through this experience, more people began to understand
                    the true meaning of inclusivity.
                </p>

                <p>
                    It became clear that we are all equal —
                    the difference lies not in our abilities,
                    but in the opportunities we are given.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-highlight-panel">
                <div>
                    <strong>Grow</strong>
                    <span>Support each individual’s potential</span>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <strong>Create</strong>
                    <span>Turn passion into real products</span>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <strong>Empower</strong>
                    <span>Opportunities build confidence</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CLOSING -->
        <div class="hbii-ending reveal">
            <h3>Creating Opportunities That Matter</h3>

            <p>
                Roti Cinta is more than a product —
                it is a story of growth, courage, and opportunity.
            </p>

            <p>
                Because sometimes, all it takes is one opportunity
                to show what someone is truly capable of.
            </p>
        </div>

        <br />

        <!-- BACK -->
        <div class="detail-back reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Collaborations" class="btn btn-secondary">← Back to Collaborations</a>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>